== Miscellaneous

- I was born and raised in Shenyang, China. I moved to Changsha to pursue my Bachelor's degree in 2015. After three wonderful years, I relocated to Urbana, IL for my Master's degree and later moved to Tuscaloosa, AL during the pandemic in 2020 and got my Ph.D. degree in 2024.

- Having been in the US, I developed a passion for flying. I have visited or transfered at several airports, with my favorites being ORD (>30 times) and DFW (12 times) in the US, NRT (6 times) in Japan, and, of course, SHE in China (numerous times).

- After I relocating to T-Town my interest in road trips has blossomed, leading me to discover numerous charming towns in the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dixie Dixie] region.

- Since this year (2023), I've been passionate about aerobic exercise, helping me shed over 30 lbs! Starting from May, I discovered strength weight training, thanks to mentors Charlie and Xiaodong, leading to significant improvements in my core power through deadlifts, bench presses, and squats.

- The year of 2024 has been challenging to me - I relocated for at least four times and worked at three states - AL to enclose my Ph.D. study, GA for intern at Delta Air Lines, and WA for intern at Amazon. Thanks to the travel benefits during my time at Delta Air Lines, I stood by > 40 DL flights and visited more than 20 major cities in Spring 2024, while completing my last chapter of my dissertation. 
